  "typical_application": "Arduino Uno/Nano core. Standalone: needs decoupling on VCC/AVCC, RESET pulled up via 10k, and either the internal 8MHz RC oscillator or an external 16MHz crystal with two ~22pF load caps on pins 9/10.",
  "gotchas": [
    "max 20MHz at 4.5-5.5V; at lower voltages the max clock drops (10MHz at 2.7V)",
    "AVCC must be powered even if the ADC is unused, or some port pins misbehave",
    "the Arduino bootloader occupies ~0.5KB of flash; bare chips ship without it",
    "RESET (pin 1) must be held high to run; a floating reset causes random restarts",
    "DIP-28 has 6 ADC channels; the TQFP/QFN packages add ADC6/ADC7"
  ],
